*.aux
*.out
*.log
*.synctex.gz
# local only, never pushed:
#   paper/   CVPR 2027 manuscript (LaTeX, v2 and v3)
#   notes/   meeting notes, write-ups, research notes, reports, figure candidates, reviews
#   others/  third-party papers and reference repos, scratch renders, old scripts
#   *.tgz in the root: hand-off bundles (e.g. dinowm_files.tgz for the HPC)
/paper/
/notes/
/others/
/*.tgz
/.harness/
